E-Commerce Microservices Application

A backend E-Commerce application developed using Spring Boot and a microservices-based architecture. The project is currently under development and consists of separate services for user management and product management, with MySQL database integration and REST APIs./

🚀 Features
User registration and management
User profile management
Role management
Product management
Brand management
Category management
Product attributes and attribute values
Product variants and variant values
Product image management
CRUD operations
REST API development
MySQL database integration
Cloudinary integration for image management
Layered architecture (Controller, Service, Repository)
